me>Binh</surname><given-names>PNT</given-names></name><name><surname>Minh</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Assessment of overweight and related health problems in children aged 6 to 11 in District 1, Ho Chi Minh City in 2002</article-title><source>Annual Report</source><year>2003</year><publisher-name>Nutrition Centre of Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam: Ho Chi Minh City</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cuong</surname><given-names>TQ</given-names></name><name><surname>Dibley</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Bowe</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanh</surname><given-names>TT</given-names></name><name><surname>Loan</surname><given-names>TT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Obesity in adults: an emerging problem in urban areas of Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam</article-title><source>Eur J Clin Nutr</source><year>2007</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>673</fpage><lpage>81</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17164831</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dieu</surname><given-names>TTH</given-names></name><name><surname>Michael</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>David</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanh</surname><given-names>TMT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence of overweight and obesity in preschool children and associated socio-demographic factors in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam</article-title><source>Int J Pediatr Obes</source><year>2007</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>40</fpage><lpage>50</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17763009</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1080/17477160601103922</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hanh</surname><given-names>TTM</given-names></name></person-group><source>Eiyokun: software for calculating Vietnamese dietary intake</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>Medical Publishing House of Vietnam</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rockett</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name><name><surname>Breitenbach</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Frazier</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name><name><surname>Witschi</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolf</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Field</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name><name><surname>Colditz</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Validation of a youth/adolescent food frequency questionnaire</article-title><source>Prev Med</source><year>1997</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>808</fpage><lpage>16</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9388792</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/pmed.1997.0200</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Black</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Critical evaluation of energy intake using the Goldberg cut-off for energy intake:basal metabolic rate. A practical guide to its calculation, use and limitations</article-title><source>Int J Obes</source><year>2000</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>1119</fpage><lpage>1130</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.ijo.0801376</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Thompson</surname><given-names>FE</given-names></name><name><surname>Byers</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dietary assessment resource manual</article-title><source>J Nutr</source><year>19